return ['domain'=>'zinn-offload','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'ha','project-id-version'=>'zinn-offload','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-01T20:49:59+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-01T20:49:59+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Media Offload'=>'Zinn® Media Offload','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-offload'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-offload','Moves this site\'s media library to Zinn® object storage and serves it from a CDN. Configured from your Zinn® dashboard — no access key is ever typed into WordPress.'=>'Yana mayar da ɗakin karatu na kafofin watsa labarai na wannan rukunin yanar gizo zuwa ma\'ajiyar abubuwa ta Zinn® kuma yana bayar da shi daga CDN. An saita shi daga allon kula na Zinn® naka — ba a taɓa rubuta maɓallin shiga a cikin WordPress ba.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'An adana. Rubuta sabuwar ƙima domin maye gurbinta.','Filter this list…'=>'Tace wannan jeri…','Filter this list'=>'Tace wannan jerin','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Babu abin da ya dace da wannan matatar.','Add a row'=>'Ƙara layi','Remove this row'=>'Cire wannan layin','Remove'=>'Cire','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — taƙaitaccen bayani','Overview'=>'Bayanin martaba','Copied'=>'An kwafa','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Kowane manhajar Zinn® a wannan dandalin, da kuma ko tana aiki.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Babu buƙatar haɗi don wannan manhaja ta ƙari.','Open settings'=>'Bude saituna','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'Ba ka da izinin canza waɗannan saitunan.','Settings sections'=>'Sassan saituna','Support'=>'Taimako','Save changes'=>'Ajiye sauye-sauye','Tools'=>'Kayan aiki','Export settings'=>'Fitar da saituna','Reset to defaults'=>'Sake saita zuwa na asali','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Wannan zai mayar da kowane saiti na wannan manhaja zuwa asali. Ci gaba?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Binciken matsala don tallafi','Import a settings file'=>'Shigo da fayil ɗin saituna','Import'=>'Shigo da','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Fayilolin da aka fitar ba sa ƙunsar kalmomin sirri, alamu ko maɓallan API — za ku buƙaci sake shigar da su a sabon rukunin yanar gizon.','Settings saved.'=>'An ajiye saituna.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Kowane saiti a kan wannan manhaja ya koma yadda yake a asali.','Done.'=>'An gama.','That action is not available.'=>'Wannan aikin ba ya samuwa.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'Ba a iya karanta wannan fayil ɗin ba. Zaɓi fayil ɗin saituna da aka fitar daga manhajar Zinn®.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Wannan fayil ɗin ya yi girma da yawa da zai zama fitarwar saituna.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Wannan fayil ɗin ba fitarwar saitunan Zinn® ba ne.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'An fitar da wannan fayil daga wata manhaja daban (%s), don haka shigar da shi a nan zai adana saitunan da wannan manhajar ba ta fahimta ba.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'An shigo da saiti %d. Ba a taɓa haɗa kalmomin sirri da maƙallan API a cikin fitarwa ba, don haka sake shigar da su.' . "\0" . 'An shigo da saituna %d. Ba a taɓa shigar da kalmomin sirri da maɓallan API a cikin fitarwa ba, don haka sake shigar da su.','Zinn Digital® did not return a token. Nothing has been changed on this site.'=>'Zinn Digital® bai dawo da wata alama ba. Ba a canza komai a wannan rukunin yanar gizon ba.','This site is no longer connected to Zinn® media offload. New uploads will stay on this server. Pair it again from your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'Wannan rukunin yanar gizon ba ya haɗe da sauke kafofin watsa labarai na Zinn®. Sabbin lodawa za su ci gaba da kasancewa a kan wannan uwar garken. Sake haɗa shi daga allon sarrafawa na Zinn Digital® naka.','Zinn Digital® answered with HTTP %d.'=>'Zinn Digital® ya amsa da HTTP %d.','Disconnected by Zinn Digital®.'=>'Zinn Digital® ya katse haɗin.','Connected'=>'An Haɗa','Connecting…'=>'Ana haɗawa…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'An haɗa, amma akwai abin da ke buƙatar kulawa','Not connected'=>'Ba a haɗa ba','Running on your own account'=>'Yana gudana a kan asusunka na kanka','We could not check this'=>'Ba mu iya duba wannan ba','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Wannan manhaja ba ta faɗi dalili ba. Aika rahoton binciken matsala kuma za mu duba.','Connection status'=>'Matsayin haɗi','Last checked %s ago.'=>'An duba na ƙarshe %s da suka wuce.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(yana budewa a sabon shafi)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'Aika wannan zuwa ga tallafin Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Wannan shi ne ainihin abin da za a aika — babu wani abu kuma babu wani abin da aka ɓoye. Kalmomin sirrinku, alamomin shaida da maɓallan API ba sa cikinsa.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Rahoton binciken matsala da za a aika','Copy to clipboard'=>'Kwafa zuwa allon kwafi','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Aika wannan rahoton zuwa ga tallafin Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'Muna buɗe muku tikitin taimako kuma muna ba da amsa ta imel. Idan ba kwa son aikawa, kwafi shi a sama sannan ku liƙa da kanku a cikin tikiti.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'Ba mu iya samun damar shiga Zinn Digital® daga wannan sabar (%s) ba. Kwafi rahoton da ke sama sannan ka buɗe tikiti a maimakon haka — babu wani abu da ba daidai ba game da saitunanku.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'An aika. Tallafin Zinn® ya sami rahotonka kuma zai ba da amsa ta imel.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'An aika. Sashen tallafi na Zinn® ya karɓi rahotonku — lamba %s — kuma zai ba da amsa ta imel.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'Kun aika rahotanni da yawa cikin kankanin lokaci. Jira na \'yan mintuna sannan ku sake gwadawa — na farkon sun isa.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® ba ta iya karɓar rahoton ba a yanzu — wannan matsalar daga gare mu take, ba daga gare ku ba. Sake gwadawa an jima kaɗan, ko kuma ku kwafi rahoton da ke sama zuwa tikiti.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'An ƙi karɓar rahoton (HTTP %d). Kwafi shi a sama sannan ka buɗe tikiti, tare da ambaton wannan lambar.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — jagorori da ayyuka','User guides'=>'Jagororin mai amfani','Read the %s user guide'=>'Karanta jagorar mai amfani ta %s','Hide this'=>'Ɓoye wannan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Bakuncin Zinn® don WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, adana bayanan yau da kullum, canja wurin shafi kyauta, da kuma allon sarrafawa da aka gina domin mutanen da ke gudanar da shafuka fiye da daya.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Kasuwar Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Sayi kuma sayar da kafaffun shafukan intanet, yankunan adireshi (domains) da wuraren sanya hanyoyin haɗi (link placements), tare da ajiye kuɗin cikin aminci har sai ɓangarorin biyu sun gamsu.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — ɗauki mutanen da suka maida wannan sana\'a','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Kasuwar mu ta masu aiki mai zaman kansu ta duniya: bincika sama da ayyuka 10,000 da aka shirya daga marubuta, masu ƙira, masu haɓakawa da ƙwararrun SEO, ko sanya aiki kuma bari su yi tayin.','Media Offload'=>'Sauke Fayilolin Midiyoyi','Connection'=>'Haɗi','What gets moved'=>'Abin da ake matsawa','How media is served'=>'Yadda ake ba da kafofin watsa labarai','Move a batch now'=>'Matsar da rukuni yanzu','Media already moved is never affected by a change here — its address does not change.'=>'Kafofin watsa labarai da aka riga aka motsa ba sa taɓa shafar canji a nan — adireshinsu ba ya canzawa.','New uploads'=>'Sababbin lodi','Move new uploads to Zinn® storage as they arrive'=>'Matsar da sabbin lodi zuwa ma\'ajiyar Zinn® yayin da suke zuwa','Existing media'=>'Kafofin watsa labarai na yanzu','Keep moving the media library that is already here'=>'Ci gaba da kwashe rumbun adana kafofin watsa labarai da ke nan a yanzu','A few files an hour, in the background, picking up where it left off. Turning this off pauses it; nothing already moved comes back.'=>'Fayiloli kaɗan a kowace sa\'a, a bango, suna ci gaba daga inda aka tsaya. Kashe wannan yana dakatar da shi; babu abin da aka riga aka matsar da zai dawo.','Files per hourly pass'=>'Fayiloli a kowane shiga na sa\'a','Each attachment is several files and every one is a full upload. Raise this on a fast host with a generous execution limit; lower it if passes are being cut short.'=>'Kowanne abin da aka maƙala ya ƙunshi fayiloli da yawa kuma kowannensu cikakken lodi ne. Ƙara wannan a kan mai masauki mai sauri tare da iyakar lokacin aiwatarwa mai yawa; rage shi idan ana yanke zagayen kafin a kammala.','Leave files smaller than'=>'Bar fayilolin da suka fi ƙanƙanta da','Kilobytes. A tiny icon costs more in the extra connection than it saves in disk, so there is rarely a reason to move one. Set to 0 to move everything.'=>'Kilobytes. Ƙaramar alama tana cin ƙarin haɗin yanar gizo fiye da yadda take ajiyewa a diski, don haka ba kasafai ake samun dalilin mayar da ɗaya ba. Saita zuwa 0 don mayar da komai.','Never move these types'=>'Kada ka taɓa matsar da waɗannan nau\'o\'in','Useful when a plugin reads a file straight off the disk — a font, a PDF a form builder stamps, an audio file a player seeks inside.'=>'Yana da amfani lokacin da manhaja mai ƙari ke karanta fayil kai tsaye daga faifai — rubutun ƙira, fayil ɗin PDF da mai tsara fom ke tambari a kai, fayil ɗin sauti da na\'urar kiɗa ke nema a ciki.','These two are the ones to be careful with — read each description before changing it.'=>'Wadannan biyun ne wadanda ya kamata a yi hankali da su — karanta kowane bayani kafin a canza shi.','Serve from Zinn® storage'=>'Bayar daga ma\'ajiyar Zinn®','Point image and file addresses at Zinn® storage'=>'Karkatar da adiresoshin hoto da fayil zuwa ma\'ajiyar Zinn®','Off, files are uploaded but still served from this server — which is the safe state while you check everything arrived. On, visitors are served from storage and this server stops carrying the traffic.'=>'A kashe, ana loda fayiloli amma har yanzu ana bayar da su daga wannan sabar — wanda shine yanayi mai aminci yayin da kake duba ko komai ya iso. A kunne, ana yi wa baƙi hidima daga ma\'ajiya kuma wannan sabar za ta daina ɗaukar zirga-zirgar.','Free the disk space'=>'Koma da sararin faifai kyauta','Delete the local copy once every size has uploaded'=>'Goge kwafin na gida da zarar an ɗora kowane girma','This is the point of offloading, and it is also the irreversible half. Leave it off until “Serve from Zinn® storage” is on and you have checked your site — a local copy is the only thing that saves you if something was missed.'=>'Wannan shi ne makasudin sauke kaya, kuma shi ne rabin da ba za a iya juyawa ba. Bar shi a kashe har sai an kunna “Bayar daga ma\'ajiyar Zinn®” kuma kun duba rukunin yanar gizonku — kwafin gida shi ne kawai abin da zai cece ku idan an rasa wani abu.','Deleting local copies cannot be undone from this screen. Take a backup first — the Zinn® Connector plugin can do that for you.'=>'Ba za a iya soke share kwafi na cikin na\'ura daga wannan allon ba. Fara ɗaukar ajiyar tsaro tukunna — manhajar Zinn® Connector za ta iya yi muku hakan.','This site is not connected to Zinn® storage yet, so there is nowhere to move media to.'=>'Wannan rukunin yanar gizon bai haɗu da ma\'ajiyar Zinn® ba tukuna, saboda haka babu inda za a matsar da fayilolin labarai.','%d attachment moved.'=>'An matsar da maƙala %d.' . "\0" . 'An matsar da haɗe-haɗe %d.','This site is not connected to Zinn® storage.'=>'Wannan shafin ba ya haɗe da ma\'ajiyar Zinn® ba.','Nothing is wrong — it has simply not been paired yet. Media stays on this server until it is.'=>'Babu matsala — kawai dai ba a haɗa shi ba tukuna. Fayilolin midiya za su ci gaba da kasancewa a kan wannan uwar garken har sai an haɗa.','Connected, but the last upload failed.'=>'An haɗa, amma ɗorawar ƙarshe ta gaza.','Try a batch now'=>'Gwada rukuni a yanzu','Connected. Every attachment has been moved.'=>'An haɗa. An mayar da kowane maƙallin fayil.','Connected. %1$s of %2$s attachments still on this server.'=>'An haɗa. %1$s daga cikin maƙalallan fayiloli %2$s na nan a kan wannan sabar har yanzu.','Moved so far'=>'An matsar ya zuwa yanzu','%1$s files, %2$s'=>'fayiloli %1$s, %2$s','Still on this server'=>'Har yanzu yana kan wannan uwar garken','%1$s of %2$s attachments'=>'%1$s cikin %2$s na abubuwan da aka makala','Served from'=>'An ɗauko daga','this server'=>'wannan uwar garke','Connect this site'=>'Haɗa wannan shafin','Open your Zinn Digital® dashboard, choose this site, open Files & databases, and press “Get a pairing code” under Images & video CDN. Paste the code below.'=>'Bude allon sarrafawa na Zinn Digital® dinka, zabi wannan shafin, bude Fayiloli & rumbun adana bayanai, sannan danna "Samu lambar hadawa" a karkashin Hotuna & bidiyo CDN. Manna lambar a kasa.','Pairing code'=>'Lambar haɗawa','Disconnect this site'=>'Cire haɗin wannan rukunin yanar gizon','New uploads will stay on this server. Media already moved keeps working — its address does not change.'=>'Sabuwar lodawa za ta tsaya a kan wannan uwar garken. Kafofin watsa labarai da aka riga aka motsa suna ci gaba da aiki — adireshinsu baya canzawa.','You do not have permission to manage this site.'=>'Ba ka da izinin sarrafa wannan rukunin yanar gizon.','Paste the pairing code from your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'Manna lambar haɗawa daga allon sarrafawar Zinn Digital® ɗinku.','Connected. New uploads will be stored with Zinn Digital® from now on, and your existing media will move in the background.'=>'An haɗa. Za a riƙa adana sabbin abubuwan da aka ɗora a Zinn Digital® daga yanzu, kuma kafafen yaɗa labaran ku da ke akwai za su koma a fage.','Disconnected. Media already moved keeps working; new uploads stay on this server.'=>'An cire haɗin. Kafofin watsa labarai da aka riga aka motsa suna ci gaba da aiki; sabbin abubuwan da aka loda suna tsayawa a kan wannan sabar.','That file could not be read from this server, so nothing was uploaded.'=>'Ba a iya karanta wannan fayil ɗin daga wannan uwar garken ba, saboda haka ba a ɗora komai ba.','This site could not stream the upload, so nothing was sent.'=>'Wannan rukunin yanar gizon ya kasa yaɗa ɗorawar, saboda haka ba a aika komai ba.','This file is %1$s and this site\'s PHP has no cURL, so the largest it can upload is %2$s.'=>'Wannan fayil ɗin girmansa %1$s ne kuma PHP na wannan rukunin yanar gizon ba shi da cURL, don haka mafi girman abin da zai iya ɗorawa shi ne %2$s.','The upload could not be completed.'=>'Ba a iya kammala lodawar ba.','Storage refused the upload (HTTP %d).'=>'Wurin ajiya ya ƙi loda fayil ɗin (HTTP %d).','Style preset'=>'Saitaccen salon','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Wurin farawa. Duk wani abu a ƙasa yana maye gurbinsa.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Yi amfani da launuka da girmana na kaina','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Bar wannan a kashe kuma za a yi amfani da saitin yadda yake daidai.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Duba bayanan sakin Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Sabis ɗin sabuntawa na Zinn® bai bayar da hanyar saukewa don wannan sabuntawa ba. Duba ko wannan rukunin yanar gizon zai iya isa ga dandalin Zinn®, sannan ka sake gwadawa.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Ba a iya sauke sabuntawar daga sabis ɗin sabuntawa na Zinn® (%s) ba. Sake gwadawa nan da \'yan mintoci.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Sabuntawar da aka saukar ta gaza wajen tantance nagartarta kuma ba a shigar da ita ba.']];